{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S03、S06等段落的感受提示仍然比较密集，纵向交替阅读有时会让视线来回切换；Y的左右分栏在同时浏览叙述和音乐感受时更直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用高亮把每段叙事的关键转折明确标出来，感受文字又贴着相应的话句展开，并通过到时出现避免所有提示同时挤在屏幕上，听众更容易边听边抓住重点。它对人物矛盾的解释也更清楚：舍不得的是被当作自己人的亲近，不愿放弃的是对自己应有的尊重，两者始终交织，最后才走向带着想念继续生活。感受方面，X不仅有情绪变化，还有具体的音型、节奏、音色、身体反应和情绪转折，细节之间也有音乐进程支撑，不只是堆砌情绪形容词。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "159dac9d-edb9-47f2-9873-df065b601bd3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T002417019600Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.687, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:25:32.721188+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c6383fbcb306a18f0a74c14c038182736b12141322af77a45c3cfd2589c60bb8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa3